[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20821.628, "timestamp": "05:47:01", "text": "那条溪流。所以，呃，我们最后说到哪儿了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20826.868, "timestamp": "05:47:06", "text": "这？我们最后……呃，我们当时就在现场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20830.51, "timestamp": "05:47:10", "text": "夏树或苏里在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20835.19, "timestamp": "05:47:15", "text": "倒下时撞到了铅笔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20837.23, "timestamp": "05:47:17", "text": "从这里开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20842.47, "timestamp": "05:47:22", "text": "好的。所以，呃，我最后停止的事情是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20845.83, "timestamp": "05:47:25", "text": "超过。所以，拍完那场戏后，我就停了下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20846.75, "timestamp": "05:47:26", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20850.51, "timestamp": "05:47:30", "text": "呃，我应该把我的诗给谁看？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20853.47, "timestamp": "05:47:33", "text": "第一的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20856.15, "timestamp": "05:47:36", "text": "嗯？如果我有机会直播所有节目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20858.31, "timestamp": "05:47:38", "text": "他会参加世界杯比赛吗？是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20865.788, "timestamp": "05:47:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20868.708, "timestamp": "05:47:48", "text": "呃，等等。这是一款恐怖游戏。等等，心跳文学俱乐部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20872.15, "timestamp": "05:47:52", "text": "是一款恐怖游戏。什么？如何？我 我 我 做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20873.788, "timestamp": "05:47:53", "text": "不知道。我知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20878.39, "timestamp": "05:47:58", "text": "但我希望我能得到一个好结局。"}]